# Baby Tracker — Testing Protocol

No automated tests. Manual verification required for every change.

## 👀 Visual check (Contractor → Human)

After every milestone, Cursor **must** tell the human exactly what to look at in the running app — not just what code changed.

- **Visible change:** tab + Hebrew label/element + before vs after (e.g. font shape, new icon, kg instead of grams).
- **Not visible yet** (e.g. `types.ts` only): say explicitly; name which later milestone will show it.
- Optional DevTools hint for CSS/font (Computed → `font-family`).

This block appears in the Cursor final message **and** in the handoff (`sessions/` + AgentMemory).

## Required checks (every change)

1. `npm run lint` — must pass with zero errors
2. `npm run build` — must complete without errors
3. `npm run dev` — server starts on port 3000

## Golden path (run at 375px width)

- Add bottle feeding (120ml offered, 110ml consumed) → appears in carousel
- Switch to Timeline → event shows up
- Add sleep start (location: CRIB) → sleep timer starts on Sleep button
- End sleep (toggle again)
- Dashboards → today appears in nutrition + sleep stats
- Edit the bottle feeding from carousel → changes save
- Delete an event from timeline → Hebrew confirm modal appears → confirm → event gone
- Delete an event → cancel → event stays
- Undo toast appears after create/log actions (no regression)

## Auth smoke test (if touching server.ts or auth flow)

- Logged out → any action shows login screen
- Login as Parent A → app loads, parent name badge shows
- Logout → login screen returns

## After touching export

- Settings → Export → set date range → download → file opens in Excel without errors
